    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lead company enrichment with AI (industry and size guess)\nFor each new lead with a company name and website, fills in a likely industry and a short outreach angle. Meant as a quick first pass, always double-check.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0192c34d-3653-5d7d-9fd1-b1ff121c67a9",
